 similarity). The fatty acid remodeling steps is critical for the integration of GPI-APs into lipid rafts (PubMed:23561846)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}